# What never needs to reach a build.
#
# What ends up in an image is decided by the COPY lines in the Dockerfile, not
# by this file: everything here is either secret, enormous, or generated. The
# repository's own source and tests are cheap to send and the local stack in
# test/local-stack builds its containers from the same context, so they stay.
.git
.github
node_modules
data
coverage
.wrangler
*.pem
*.jwk.json
.env
.env.*
.dev.vars
